WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-04 - Shadows on the Slate
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: 1984: 1883 (The Rock Opera)

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.500
When the tape stops spinning at three A.M.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.000
And the gaslamps flicker at the curtain hem

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.500
The night terrors scratch at the window pane

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.000
Whispering our names in the falling rain

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.500
My body is heavy, the wheels are still

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.000
And the shadows creep across the sill

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Reach across the dark and hold my hand

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Anchor me back to solid land

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Shadows on the slate in the dead of night!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Hold onto me until the morning light!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Even in the dream where I can run

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.000
I still need my brother when the day is done!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Breathe in the dark, steady and slow

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Don't let the night terrors pull us below!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:08.000
In the manor house of our own design

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Every broken bone is fine

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.000
I stand at the gate in a velvet dress

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Untouched by the years of helplessness

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:32.000
But when the thunder shakes the floor

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.000
You're the only lock upon the door

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.000
I'm right here, Claire, the doors are barred

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:07.000
The iron gates are standing guard

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:13.000
Close your eyes, let the prism shine

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Your heartbeat is safe next to mine

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:28.000
Shadows on the slate in the dead of night...

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Hold onto me until the morning light...

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:58.000
Safe inside the Hollow Square...

